ps://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1495599-compact-the-grimaldi-family-circus?p=1495633#post1495633\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm afraid I don't know enough about Princess to comment. As for sterotypes, though...<br /> <br /> The Union: &amp;quot;A couple of these guys popped up last week while Bluebell and I were taking care of a bloodsucker. Really saved our asses. They may be a little humorless, but they've got the right idea.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Ashwood Abbey: <i>Gag, spit.</i> &amp;quot;What the hell kind of sick fu-&amp;quot; <i>Continues vomiting.</i><br /> <br /> The Long Night: &amp;quot;Somebody <i>is</i> thinking of the children, Karen.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Any specific opinions on various splats, or are they solely focused on clown and child related events, without much care for source and species besides \u201chow do I kill this fake clown/child eater\u201d?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27633-the-froggy-ninja","name":"The Froggy Ninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-27T19:02:58-07:00","id":1495706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Froggy Ninja</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1495599-compact-the-grimaldi-family-circus?p=1495705#post1495705\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Any specific opinions on various splats, or are they solely focused on clown and child related events, without much care for source and species besides \u201chow do I kill this fake clown/child eater\u201d?</div> </div> </div> </div>I see this group as being relatively tunnel visioned, and without a <i>lot</i> of lore focus. They may have <i>some</i> idea what things are out there, but I don't know that they'll have many opinions beyond their remit. The ones that know about the True Fae probably <i>hate</i> 'em, what's with the whole &quot;stealing kids&quot; thing, but I don't know that there're any beasties out there that routinely sully the motley on a systemic basis. I'm open to suggestions though!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","user":"HobbitGuy1420","date":". 10-27-2022, 10:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-27T19:22:51-07:00","id":1495707,"title":"","content":"Not that I would ask you to fully make any, but do you have any idle thoughts of Merits or Tactics you might want to make(or at least see) to support the Circus's particular angle to the Vigil?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-27T19:58:25-07:00","id":1495708,"title":"","content":"Hrmmm... Tactics I can see appearing in Cells from the Circus:<ul><li>A morale-based Tactic based on using humor to defuse tension (helping to resolve or reduce Integrity- and other stress-based Conditions or Tilts)</li> <li>A Tactic that uses juggling techniques to pass a thrown weapon back and forth before attack, reducing the target's Defense against attacks as it's confusing where it'll come from.</li> <li>Gymnastics-based traversal tactics (cheerleader throws, pratfalls to avoid fall damage, etc.)</li> </ul><br /> There could also be a Fighting Style based on using stage combat techniques (which are also used for slapstick like clowning) to reduce and avoid incoming damage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","user":"HobbitGuy1420","date":". 10-27-2022, 11:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-28T21:21:00-07:00","id":1495798,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HobbitGuy1420</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1495599-compact-the-grimaldi-family-circus?p=1495706#post1495706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see this group as being relatively tunnel visioned, and without a <i>lot</i> of lore focus. They may have <i>some</i> idea what things are out there, but I don't know that they'll have many opinions beyond their remit. The ones that know about the True Fae probably <i>hate</i> 'em, what's with the whole &amp;quot;stealing kids&amp;quot; thing, but I don't know that there're any beasties out there that routinely sully the motley on a systemic basis. I'm open to suggestions though!</div> </div> </div> </div>Something that might be interesting to note is that the Grivaldi are themselves fairly likely to spawn dangerous Clown Spirits. Interestingly, this might develop a variable ectosystem where some pick up concepts like protection and justice from the Hunts while others might pick up violence. Such spirits would then likely quarrel among themselves, potentially causing clown hauntings if they find a verge or become powerful enough to breach the Gauntlet themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27633-the-froggy-ninja","name":"The Froggy Ninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-28T23:46:45-07:00","id":1495803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Froggy Ninja</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1495599-compact-the-grimaldi-family-circus?p=1495798#post1495798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Something that might be interesting to note is that the Grivaldi are themselves fairly likely to spawn dangerous Clown Spirits. Interestingly, this might develop a variable ectosystem where some pick up concepts like protection and justice from the Hunts while others might pick up violence. Such spirits would then likely quarrel among themselves, potentially causing clown hauntings if they find a verge or become powerful enough to breach the Gauntlet themselves.</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean that the clown monster hunters hunting monster clowns causes clown monsters to hunt?!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-29T07:56:15-07:00","id":1495828,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HobbitGuy1420</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1495599-compact-the-grimaldi-family-circus?p=1495803#post1495803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You mean that the clown monster hunters hunting monster clowns causes clown monsters to hunt?!</div> </div> </div> </div>I think he means that because they are hunters who are clowns, hunting will cause spirits of hunting and fear and such to take form of clowns. Though this misses the point where you said these hunters strictly don't dress as clowns when hunting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-29T10:59:53-07:00","id":1495838,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1495599-compact-the-grimaldi-family-circus?p=1495828#post1495828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think he means that because they are hunters who are clowns, hunting will cause spirits of hunting and fear and such to take form of clowns. Though this misses the point where you said these hunters strictly don't dress as clowns when hunting</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I know, I just enjoyed the tongue-twister. :P<br /> <br /> I think the possibility of Violent Clown Spirits might be one reason that more knowledgeable Traditionalists prefer Black Bloc with Whiteface rather than the Warclown look. Younger members and Guardians might go Warclown as a &quot;you wanna see a violent clown?! I'll show you a violent clown!&quot; deal, but it's a minority in the Circus.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-29T11:41:41-07:00","id":1495839,"title":"","content":"More the idea that clownery will generate clown spirits which want to follow the clowns around, and the existence of a clown organization will itself produce clown-compatible Essence mixed with the various Resonances of the Grimaldi. Not wearing clown face would reduce the occurrence of potentially dangerous clown spirits but is unlikely to truly eliminate it, considering how integral clowning is to their self-image and their Vigil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27633-the-froggy-ninja","name":"The Froggy Ninja","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-29T21:14:11-07:00","id":1495865,"title":"","content":"I mean... they'll never have to worry about being out of a job? :P","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-31T01:40:48-07:00","id":1495950,"title":"","content":"This, I like. I also wouldn't be too surprised if someone were to eventually take this thing, or at least the general concept of it, and run with it until it was a fully fleshed out Compact. I mean, P:TH started out with the og creators pretty much convinced that no one would take their conception of 'Magical Girls in CofD' with any amount of seriousness, and look where it is now!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-01T16:15:38-07:00","id":1496072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1495599-compact-the-grimaldi-family-circus?p=1495950#post1495950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This, I like. I also wouldn't be too surprised if someone were to eventually take this thing, or at least the general concept of it, and run with it until it was a fully fleshed out Compact. I mean, P:TH started out with the og creators pretty much convinced that no one would take their conception of 'Magical Girls in CofD' with any amount of seriousness, and look where it is now!</div> </div> </div> </div>What would be needed to flesh it out to a full-fledged Compact? I admit I don't have (nor have money for) Hunter 2E; I based the benefits on the stuff I saw on Codex of Darkness.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-01T17:13:07-07:00","id":1496075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HobbitGuy1420</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1495599-compact-the-grimaldi-family-circus?p=1496072#post1496072\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What would be needed to flesh it out to a full-fledged Compact? I admit I don't have (nor have money for) Hunter 2E; I based the benefits on the stuff I saw on Codex of Darkness.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, it's got all it needs. It's a pretty lean concept to begin with, and it's better as it is for it's punch than it would be if you tried to bloat it up.<br /> <br /> There are some interesting things you might do by building on the Tactics/Merits question I asked previously, but that's not strictly needed for it to sell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-01T18:10:02-07:00","id":1496077,"title":"","content":"On that topic, a very rough draft, with *no* idea about balance: <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><u><b>Tactic: Cut the tension</b></u></span></div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Laughter can ease pain and soothe stress, and nobody knows that better than clowns of the Grimaldi Family Circus. Members have learned how to use their trained humor to ease the mental strains of the Hunt.<br /> <br /> Certain members of the troupe keep an eye on chosen audience members to make sure the humor's having the proper effect, while others work with the primary actor to serve as straight-men and otherwise set up a comforting rapport. Note that members of the troupe enacting this Tactic <i>can </i>be participants, but every participant who is also a target inflicts a -1 penalty to their own rolls and to the primary actors, cumulative.<br /> <br /> <b>Action: </b>Extended (two minutes per roll, target 4 successes per target experiencing a Mental Condition)<br /> <br /> <b>Dice pools:</b> Primary: Manipulation <i>or</i> Presence + Expression. Secondary: Manipulation <i>or</i> Presence plus Expression (Yes-and the bit, 0/3), Wits + Socialize <i>or</i> Empathy (Read the room's mood, 1/3),<br /> <br /> <b>Roll Results<br /> <br /> Success:</b> The targeted characters may immediately shed one non-Persistent Mental condition per character without resolving it. These Conditions must have been gained within the last scene.<br /> <br /> <b>Exceptional Success:</b> The characters may each shed one Persistent or non-Persistent Mental Condition without resolving them. These Conditions must have been gained within the last scene.<br /> <br /> <b>Failure:</b> The humor lands poorly. The primary actor gains the Guilty Condition (or another applicable Condition, if already Guilty).<br /> <br /> <b>Dramatic Failure: </b>The humor lands <i>very</i> poorly. All participants gain the Guilty Condition (or another applicable Condition, if already Guilty).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","user":"HobbitGuy1420","date":". 11-19-2022, 07:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-25T10:42:30-07:00","id":1506425,"title":"","content":"What do you think a good symbol of the Circus would be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27385-cross-a-way","name":"Cross-a-way","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27385_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-25T21:10:11-07:00","id":1506457,"title":"","content":"As in, a logo or sigil? Hrmmm... <br /> <br /> Ooh: A stylized crying clown makeup design on a cracked egg.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user"