-way","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27385_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-23T12:31:48-07:00","id":1536161,"title":"","content":"Since circus/theater training focus on choreographed dodge, maybe they could have 9 again and/or even rote quality for the Dodge Action?<br /> <br /> I also think they could have a number of feints or feint-like actions, maybe using the Dodge to give some bonus to an ally.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-23T15:18:46-07:00","id":1536170,"title":"","content":"Some ideas off the top of my head:<br /> <br /> Pies &amp; Seltzer: Reduce penalty for improvised ranged weapons by 1. A hit with a messy substance instills a penalty to certain actions until the target can clean their face.<br /> Pratfall: Take take fewer penalties when going prone. In addition, take less fall damage<br /> Draw attention: Choose an enemy and make a Performance roll. Their defense is penalized based on the results of the roll.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-11T12:20:49-07:00","id":1538440,"title":"","content":"Antagonists!<br /> <br /> Nibbles the Clown (Chronicles of Darkness pages 154-155) is an excellent antagonist for a cell of Grimaldi hunters. In addition, I'll toss more in here as I think of them.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Gilbert &quot;Giggles&quot; Nelson</span></b><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Shhh, shhshhshhh. Hush down, now, little one. We can play soon!&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <b>Description: </b>Out of his makeup, Gilbert is an unremarkable-looking man, with a doughy face and a paunch that hides unexpected strength. Out of makeup, he tends to have a listless, almost vacant expression. In makeup is where he comes alive, bringing a near-manic intensity to performances... and to what comes after. Giggles is well on his way to becoming a Slasher.<br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Intelligence 2, Wits 3, Resolve 2, Strength 4, Dexterity 3, Stamina 2, Presence 3, Manipulation 2, Composure 1<br /> <b>General dice pools:</b> Interacting with children 6, Hiding his tracks 5, Finding A Playmate 4<br /> <b>Combat dice pools:</b> Knives 6, Manhandling People 6,<br /> <b>Initiative Modifier:</b> +4<br /> <b>Defense:</b> 4<br /> <b>Health:</b> 7<br /> <b>Willpower</b><b>:</b> 3<br /> <b>Size:</b> 5<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 11<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">The Smiler</span></b><br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Hehe. Hehehehe. He he he ha ha ha HA HA <b>HA HA HA!&quot;</b></i><br /> <br /> <b>Description: </b>Some bloodsuckers are twisted into dreadful, inhuman shapes by the transition to undeath. The Smiler is one of those. Death bleached their skin as pale as bone, rendered them inhumanly thin and lanky, and rendered their mouth a ragged, bloodstained maw that stretches from ear to ear. The newly-minted monster liked the look, accessorizing it with garish, mismatched clothing and dying their colorless fringe of lank hair blood red.<br /> <b>Attributes:</b> Intelligence 3, Wits 4, Resolve 3, Strength 2, Dexterity 5, Stamina 4, Presence 2, Manipulation 4, Composure 3<br /> <b>Skills: </b>Occult 3, Athletics 3, Brawl 2, Stealth 5, Empathy 3, Intimidation 2, Subterfuge 2<br /> <b>Merits: </b>Anonymity \u2022\u2022, Double Jointed \u2022\u2022, Relentless \u2022, Striking Looks \u2022\u2022, Grappling \u2022\u2022,<br /> <b>Potency: </b>4<br /> <b>Willpower</b><b>:</b> 6<br /> <b>Virtue: </b>Playful<br /> <b>Vice:</b> Murderous<br /> <b>Aspirations:</b> To toy with their food, paralyzing them with fear before draining them dry.<br /> <b>Initiative: </b>8<br /> <b>Defense: </b>7<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 12<br /> <b>Health:</b> 7<br /> <b>Bans: </b>The Smiler cannot feed from those who are unafraid of them.<br /> <b>Banes: </b>Fire, sunlight, damage to the heart.<br /> <b>Dread Powers: </b>Jump Scare, Madness &amp; Terror, Natural Weapons \u2022, Regenerate \u2022 (Requires blood)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1168,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","user":"HobbitGuy1420","date":". 07-12-2024, 05:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1168-hobbitguy1420","name":"HobbitGuy1420","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"332"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}